createDecoArchitecture(scene)
    Build a twelve by sixteen meter salon with a six-and-a-half meter ceiling.
    Use emerald lacquer, brass, ivory, black onyx, velvet and opal materials.
    Batch repeated box architecture and checkerboard tiles into instances.
    Add stepped cornices, fluted pilasters, fan and sunburst reliefs,
    chandeliers, lounges, geometric palms and a central armillary on a plinth.
    Return floor surface, doorway selection surface, sculpture and canStand.
    canStand rejects points outside the room or inside furnishings and plinth.
    Keep the central aisle and approach to the doorway clear.
    All geometry is procedural; no text, images or outside resource fetches.
